---
// CapitalMobilitySpectrum.astro
---

<div class="my-12 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  
  <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-1">Illustration 7</div>
    <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium m-0">The Capital-Mobility Spectrum</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="p-8 pb-12">
    
    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-8">
      <div>Greater Openness</div>
      <div>Greater State Control</div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative w-full h-12">
      <!-- Gradient Bar -->
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 right-0 h-3 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-amber-400 to-rose-500 shadow-inner opacity-90"></div>
      
      <!-- Nodes -->
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-[5%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center group">
        <div class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-4 border-emerald-500 shadow-md z-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-125"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-6 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Singapore</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-[35%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center group">
        <div class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-4 border-emerald-400 shadow-md z-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-125"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-6 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Malaysia</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-[65%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center group">
        <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-4 border-amber-500 shadow-lg z-10 ring-2 ring-amber-200 dark:ring-amber-900/50"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-7 whitespace-nowrap text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">India</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-[95%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center group">
        <div class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-4 border-rose-500 shadow-md z-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-125"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-6 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">China</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-14 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-center italic border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 pt-6">
      This is not a league table. It is a conceptual spectrum of how different monetary systems balance capital mobility against domestic policy autonomy and financial stability.
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
